			"widgets_values":[
				"### Global Metadata\nGenre: folk. Mood: hopeful. Target song duration: about 240 seconds. Language: Mandarin lyrics. Structure: 自动判断（按时长与平台）. Intro: 短（4-8秒）. Lyric rhyme guidance: AAAA; preserve natural singability. Creative latitude: 平衡扩写（推荐）. Output detail: 标准.\n\n### Vocal Details\nLead vocal: warm male vocal. Core instrumentation: acoustic guitar and piano. Keep the vocal character consistent with this selection.\n\n### Arrangement\nGlobal arc: plainspoken verses establish daily pressure, the pre-chorus gathers resolve, and the chorus opens into a communal, hopeful release. Sections: Intro > Verse 1 > Chorus 1 > Verse 2 > Chorus 2 > Bridge > Final Chorus > Outro. Core instruments: acoustic guitar and piano. a short 4-8 second instrumental; sparse entry, gradual layer growth, and a clear peak before the outro. plainspoken and human in the verses, then firm and communal at the hook. Keep transitions continuous and the ending fully resolved.  Let the tempo follow the selected genre and mood."
